      "widgets_values": [
        "AIDA FULL \u2014 OBJECT ONLY (v2)\n\nUpload FRONT. For 2/3/4 views, select the additional LEFT/BACK/RIGHT photos in their dropdowns. Leave every unused side set to (none). No disconnecting wires, duplicate images, manual boxes, or empty-table reference needed.\n\nThe Aida stage automatically locates the object on the ChArUco print, segments it with SAM 3.1, removes the board, and gives every active view a shared crop scale. Check the OBJECT ONLY preview before inspecting the mesh.\n\nRequires the aida_scan extension shipped with this repository. Restart ComfyUI with --whitelist-custom-nodes aida_scan if custom nodes are disabled. Reopen this v2 workflow; an already-open old BiRefNet workflow does not update automatically."
      ]
